[the idea is to throw rocks at the priest from maximum throwing range]

I'd strongly recommend you only try this if your strength is 16 or
above. Priests can summon insects (or snakes) even if you're several
squares away. But if you're sufficiently far away, the priest
apparently won't cast any spells _at all_ - no insect summons, no
self-healing.

Happily, the deity will not hurl lightning bolts at you if you attack
a cleric from outside the temple, so there's no need to account for
the range of divine lightning ...

